{"id":4111,"date":"2025-06-04T02:04:05","date_gmt":"2025-06-04T02:04:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4111"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:20:44","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:20:44","slug":"tiktok-ads-la-gi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/tiktok-ads-la-gi\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Ads l\u00e0 g\u00ec? Quy tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1eeb A-Z"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"PGcSdV6BaoOfNjxXOTUljdtRg3e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TRa5dQY0Pobl3dxaRqPlKw4ggGf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Ads l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng qua video ng\u1eafn \u0111\u1ea7y s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o. V\u1edbi kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng lan truy\u1ec1n c\u1ef1c nhanh v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed t\u1ed1i \u01b0u. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u ngay v\u1ec1 TikTok Ads t\u1eeb h\u00f4m nay!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOy9dVFUJop3uHxPSsVlSuVIgqf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HRqWdFNAqoe0RxxI7xYlgls1g3U\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>TikTok Ads l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TZCydOR0BoFEdxx9pW4lctjagYf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok Ads l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i TikTok, cho ph\u00e9p doanh nghi\u1ec7p ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c video ng\u1eafn s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, thu h\u00fat v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 viral. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 marketing hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i gi\u00fap t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u00e0nh vi mua h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, nhanh ch\u00f3ng. V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng video kho\u1ea3ng 15 gi\u00e2y, TikTok Ads mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m g\u1ea7n g\u0169i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, d\u1ec5 t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CeqZd9S0uoAkeExCfqUlkjF3g2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean TikTok, qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c trang th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed nh\u01b0 Shopee, Lazada, Tiki ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i kh\u00e1c. Nh\u1edd kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng lan t\u1ecfa m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, TikTok Ads ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng trong vi\u1ec7c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 gia t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4116\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4116\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4116\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35.png\" alt=\"TikTok Ads\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/35-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4116\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok Ads<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PGcSdV6BaoOfNjxXOTUljdtRg3e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A3Ypd0gKxo9iDLx034ll8W2BgIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KPfWdAcngo02SXxAIgvlo5N4g8b\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>V\u00ec sao n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn s\u1eed dung TikTok Ads?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V9dUdalYVoWXoHxFpSilXQswgPh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 k\u00eanh qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed h\u1ee3p l\u00fd. V\u1edbi h\u01a1n 1,7 t\u1ef7 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u (50 tri\u1ec7u t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam) v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trung b\u00ecnh 90\u2013120 ph\u00fat\/ng\u00e0y, TikTok Ads gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng, t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1edd video ng\u1eafn sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng, chi ph\u00ed CPM\/CPC th\u1ea5p, v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n ngay trong \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng qua TikTok Shop.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ERPUdv1WEoXOwdxScyula9nsg1d\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OJoodJmBSo3HNYxvr5al0mBqgEe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1c d\u1ea1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Ads<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EKCbdR1XPocUKDx6ZZBl0V5YgYc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, TikTok cung c\u1ea5p <strong>2 d\u1ea1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o ch\u00ednh<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nhu c\u1ea7u kh\u00e1c nhau:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-VMuHdFX3woULUbxQkpVlhrrZgWf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Self- Serve (T\u1ef1 ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F9Hld5SH0odjADx7w2PltNGwgPe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, doanh nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1ecf, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u. T\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, t\u1ef1 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch, ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o trong tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd TikTok Ads.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VMxpdSGkuoIfp3xrjxtlPNligOf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; <strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong>: Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng, d\u1ec5 h\u1ecdc, chi ph\u00ed t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u linh ho\u1ea1t (ch\u1ec9 t\u1eeb v\u00e0i tr\u0103m ngh\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed3ng).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lbq1d0Z3fo6IEsx6do6lVq3Wgpg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; <strong>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/strong>: Kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n, thi\u1ebfu insight s\u00e2u t\u1eeb h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 th\u1ea5p n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 kinh nghi\u1ec7m.<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-QV5jdVQwxoN9uoxsj1yliBvhgkc\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQVFdmoJoow1iRxw9LAlqSOwg2f\"><em>Theo m\u1ed9t b\u00e1o c\u00e1o t\u1eeb Statista n\u0103m 2023, \u201cg\u1ea7n 15% ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng TikTok g\u1eb7p kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n trong vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng\u201d. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y cho th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng Self-Serve khi t\u1ea1o qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, v\u00ec h\u1ecd c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf n\u1ed9i dung tr\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 h\u00f2a h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Thi\u1ebfu kinh nghi\u1ec7m ho\u1eb7c hi\u1ec3u bi\u1ebft v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m cho qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00f4ng \u201cgi\u1ed1ng n\u1ed9i dung ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng\u201d c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t th\u1ea5p, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong 30 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean khi h\u1ecd c\u00f2n \u0111ang l\u00e0m quen v\u1edbi TikTok Ads Manager.<\/em><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Fms0dKZqKoNqCAx55S2lxaJegtf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Agency<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V5NKduRnzoZFTSxk4uulrB4ogUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; <strong>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u1eeba v\u00e0 l\u1edbn, ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi mu\u1ed1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TVaqdSlAgoNS1Rx0IqJle2VygAe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh b\u1edfi c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c (TikTok Agency Partner) c\u00f3 chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n cao.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzbJd0YIhosWgYxOkBzlu5nZgqb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div>&#8211; <strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZyZwdKEyyolaAwxIw70lyN8IgeN\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung, thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FB7pdEL5AoaxTUxokLdlqVQxgWh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng n\u00e2ng cao (whitelist, spark ads, t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n credit,\u2026).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TLGbdkFQGov6wUxvdHqla82Og1e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 thanh to\u00e1n linh ho\u1ea1t, gi\u00e1 CPM\/CPC th\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPsYd01uzo4S38xzj6MlXF4Fgi7\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; <strong>H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf<\/strong>: Ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 cao h\u01a1n nh\u01b0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n r\u00f5 r\u1ec7t.<\/div>\n<blockquote class=\" old-record-id-B3OGdN9GHoJyPZxvfXylc1Yqgdb\" data-type=\"quote_container\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HWcyduYm5oS2eexTVUjlJSqtg0d\"><em>Doanh nghi\u1ec7p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Agency c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ROAS (return on ad spend) cao h\u01a1n trung b\u00ecnh 30\u201360% so v\u1edbi Self-Serve.<\/em><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/blockquote>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZJxqdv85ToW6olx3eGVlWpbGgNd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4114\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4114\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4114\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/33-1.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c d\u1ea1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Ads: C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ebfn doanh nghi\u1ec7p. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/33-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/33-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/33-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/33-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/33-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4114\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1c d\u1ea1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Ads: C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ebfn doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PGcSdV6BaoOfNjxXOTUljdtRg3e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QWaNdOLHOod6Mfxqf7mlT5ozgii\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ch\u1ea1y TikTok Ads.<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GNsKdmcOHojnVqxwc9ElT22fgOe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 288px;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"144\" \/>\n<col width=\"141\" \/>\n<col width=\"214\" \/>\n<col width=\"218\" \/>\n<col width=\"133\" \/>\n<col width=\"165\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>V\u1ecb tr\u00ed hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>Th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 24px; text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh ph\u00ed<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 96px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">In-Feed Ads<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">Xen k\u1ebd trong m\u1ee5c \u201cD\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n\u201d<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Giao di\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 video th\u01b0\u1eddng<br \/>\n&#8211; C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 like, share, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, CTA<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">&#8211; D\u1ec5 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t<br \/>\n&#8211; T\u1ed1i \u01b0u chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i<br \/>\n&#8211; Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p m\u1ecdi doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">9\u201315 gi\u00e2y <br \/>\n(khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb)<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">CPM \/ CPC \/ CPV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 72px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left;\">TopView<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left;\">Ngay khi m\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, to\u00e0n m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb gi\u00e1n \u0111o\u1ea1n<br \/>\n&#8211; G\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ea1nh<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left;\">&#8211; Nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u cao<br \/>\n&#8211; L\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho ra m\u1eaft chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch l\u1edbn<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left;\">T\u1ed1i \u0111a 60 gi\u00e2y<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 72px; text-align: left;\">CPM (hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb 100% v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng target)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 96px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">Branded Hashtag<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">Trang Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 (Explore)<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">&#8211; T\u1ea1o th\u1eed th\u00e1ch v\u1edbi hashtag<br \/>\n&#8211; C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng &amp; nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n ri\u00eang<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">&#8211; T\u0103ng UGC<br \/>\n&#8211; Lan to\u1ea3 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br \/>\n&#8211; K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i m\u1ea1nh v\u1edbi c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">3\u20136 ng\u00e0y chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/td>\n<td style=\"height: 96px; text-align: left;\">Theo g\u00f3i chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FHJ3deZgUodShmxrKNOl4PgtgTT\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Sd0qdo8DYoSom0xpPKolbQMugrk\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb g\u00ec khi ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WNIKdjYDmonWzGx15idlRtR9goe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>1. X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ThFydtvG3odeQwx6M15lFRUygwc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, l\u01b0\u1ee3t truy c\u1eadp website, doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thu h\u00fat ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8EsdFj6ZouOl4xXkTplSbOZgUu\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. X\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T1eBdMza0oJmxMxtGk3lYDXpgkh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh, khu v\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd, s\u1edf th\u00edch, h\u00e0nh vi, th\u1eddi gian online,&#8230;<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OLSGdlDGeoXM3WxUMbclYy23gwb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Ads<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SPwZdb70voSHqkxCIfYlD4fAgsf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Truy c\u1eadp: <a href=\"https:\/\/ads.tiktok.com\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/ads.tiktok.com<\/a><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NhbRd9lstoKIwjxzG1Bl0VnfgPh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Ads Manager<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KbXOdrWn4okVZKxRcvaldCMoggh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iavkd7NJNo3rQQxSztWlmpTjgwD\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">G\u1eafn m\u00e3 TikTok Pixel (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3 website) \u0111\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TKZYd4HTsoxWgzxQsIwlIgCXg9d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>4. Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MWLidSopeo8HqrxJw0flXsjlgxb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Xem c\u00e1c video xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 trong ng\u00e0nh<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V9DGdiHpvoqmEAxPtr1lxFVSgSg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ghi ch\u00fa: Nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n, Caption, Hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng, Hook 3 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u video<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGbxdiKegoUFtnxEtsmlFQ6mgPe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>5. S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung video<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJiudyN9OouFc4xCRdJlJJbUgUg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng: 6\u201315 gi\u00e2y (thu h\u00fat t\u1eeb 3 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CQ6qdzkeDotijLxwI3Kl4CJdgwg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00f3 Call to Action (CTA) r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng: \u201cMua ngay\u201d, \u201cT\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u th\u00eam\u201d, \u201cTr\u01b0\u1ee3t l\u00ean\u201d<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LiAvdtF5ToJLqyxnMUuljgE0gGb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng: d\u1ecdc 9:16 (HD)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ECkndan2qowZ5JxxWe5lMarEgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea1o 2\u20133 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 A\/B Testing<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XE0NdwKHHoCWXZxP5xhlTM3Wgbf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>6. Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OjtSdRLL7o1m1AxVlwFlkBPZguc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u: <strong>200.000\u0111 \u2013 300.000\u0111\/ng\u00e0y<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWIudNoeIoc8BmxxGMKlY74eg1b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chia nh\u1ecf \u0111\u1ec3 test c\u00e1c nh\u00f3m: Theo t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 theo n\u1ed9i dung video<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ONT9dj5DmoLT1rxPr0elgrAEg6d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>7. Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SV4fdZXHcotoSFxwk5zljdWIgRf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1ecdn: M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau\/ \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng\/ V\u1ecb tr\u00ed hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb <strong>(n\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 Automatic Placement)<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VFCYdrYZDo6ey4xH6yIlZW53gPg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea3i video ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng video \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JzusdPAoboL61OxsqADlOb7vgHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ebft caption h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, ch\u00e8n t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jr4Jd2N6Yo1IytxFIhjlLGAGgLc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>8. Theo d\u00f5i &amp; t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQGtdJJrOof3udxqxXfl6jqBgad\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo d\u00f5i c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1: CPM (chi ph\u00ed 1000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb), CTR (t\u1ec9 l\u1ec7 nh\u1ea5p), CVR (t\u1ec9 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qj7TddZHdoteH9xF5JdlbtuRgLg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1eaft qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o k\u00e9m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NNYdd9z7FoaHaHxkpMEl9XMcgsc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u0103ng ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch cho qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KROadqdWHo11SBxMpydl1SMpgwe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m li\u00ean t\u1ee5c v\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung, CTA, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng,\u2026<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZzfCdl7z7oqGsQxS5Uqls3PKg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>M\u1eb9o nh\u1ecf:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PF63djjcPo49yuxBqsflevjXgMj\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>D\u00f9ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1eadt, t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng th\u1eadt \u2192 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 g\u1ea7n g\u0169i<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pu22dSR1po6reUxosNglV8MTgdh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p KOL\/creator nh\u1ecf \u2192 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RDk2dVKE3oPH1yxSNMal3GklgSd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4115\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4115\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4115\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1.png\" alt=\"Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb n\u1ed9i dung, ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau th\u1eadt r\u00f5. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/34-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4115\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb n\u1ed9i dung, ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau th\u1eadt r\u00f5.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PGcSdV6BaoOfNjxXOTUljdtRg3e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AIsQdbEsGowpzkxS8GPlPn0MgPc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed dung TikTok Ads cho doanh nghi\u00eap.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HONndHfaFoTkxJxISEKlppclgQb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng TikTok Ads mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 trong vi\u1ec7c ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u1ebb v\u00e0 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NVP7dgKcvoLwesxZ9phl29oIgce\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng l\u1edbn:<\/strong> TikTok c\u00f3 h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 gi\u1edbi tr\u1ebb \u2013 nh\u00f3m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng cho nhi\u1ec1u ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SPeudCAZSohcSDxK2LvlB4rxgXd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u nhanh ch\u00f3ng:<\/strong> Nh\u1edd \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng video ng\u1eafn, sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 lan truy\u1ec1n, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn r\u1ed9ng r\u00e3i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EjoTdfNgioHAo0xiOBWltJFCgdg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u1eafm \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:<\/strong> TikTok Ads cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh theo \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i, gi\u1edbi t\u00ednh, s\u1edf th\u00edch, h\u00e0nh vi,\u2026 gi\u00fap qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u1ea7n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UCGedS47lo5sjJxEpUslG8Pvguh\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Chi ph\u00ed h\u1ee3p l\u00fd:<\/strong> D\u00f9 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch nh\u1ecf, doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u1eabn c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ea1y th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u d\u1ea7n, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u1ea3 doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u1eeba v\u00e0 nh\u1ecf.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R29XdOscgoQubLx8bWmloeTHgSc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>D\u1ec5 t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o:<\/strong> TikTok khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00e2n th\u1eadt, g\u1ea7n g\u0169i \u2013 doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t qu\u00e1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p m\u00e0 v\u1eabn hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BYTJdbXtRor4qLxGrIUlNnaKgRf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1eabn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1ec1 website, Shopee, Lazada,\u2026 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t mua ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LIlhd6K7Foa9LExefz3lzASQgwg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4118\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4118\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4118\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/37.png\" alt=\"T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhanh, ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/37.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/37-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/37-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/37-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/37-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4118\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhanh, ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"PGcSdV6BaoOfNjxXOTUljdtRg3e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FvaCd8GCsoBoYBxgXtqlRYGGgof\" style=\"text-align: left;\">So s\u00e1nh TikTok Ads v\u1edbi Facebook Ads \u2013 N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n?<\/h2>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-TkiqdXVpvoh2twxIxSRluPjcgVq\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table style=\"width: 99.1461%;\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"199\" \/>\n<col width=\"330\" \/>\n<col width=\"284\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 25.9169%;\"><strong>Ti\u00eau ch\u00ed<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 43.3922%;\"><strong>TikTok Ads<\/strong><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 50.2123%;\"><strong>Facebook Ads<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng ch\u00ednh<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">Gen Z (16\u201324 tu\u1ed5i), th\u00edch video ng\u1eafn, gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">\u0110a d\u1ea1ng (t\u1eeb Gen Z \u0111\u1ebfn Gen X), th\u00edch n\u1ed9i dung \u0111a d\u1ea1ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">\u0110\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00ednh<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">Video ng\u1eafn (6\u201315 gi\u00e2y), b\u1eaft trend, \u00e2m nh\u1ea1c s\u00f4i \u0111\u1ed9ng<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">\u1ea2nh, video, carousel, text \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng linh ho\u1ea1t<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">Kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn Gen Z<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">R\u1ea5t cao, Gen Z ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1ea1nh<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">T\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ed1i, Gen Z \u0111ang r\u1eddi d\u1ea7n kh\u1ecfi n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">Chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">Trung b\u00ecnh, d\u1ec5 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u1edbi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch nh\u1ecf<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">Linh ho\u1ea1t, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cao n\u1ebfu c\u1ea1nh tranh ng\u00e0nh l\u1edbn<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c (engagement)<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">Cao \u2013 nh\u1edd n\u1ed9i dung gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed, d\u1ec5 viral<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">Trung b\u00ecnh \u2013 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c nhi\u1ec1u v\u00e0o n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">Th\u1ea5p \u2013 trung b\u00ecnh (tu\u1ef3 ng\u00e0nh)<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">Cao \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u00e2u n\u0103m<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">Kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u theo h\u00e0nh vi<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">T\u1ed1t, nh\u01b0ng ch\u01b0a chi ti\u1ebft b\u1eb1ng Facebook<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">R\u1ea5t t\u1ed1t, nh\u1eafm s\u00e2u theo h\u00e0nh vi, s\u1edf th\u00edch, m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.9169%; text-align: left;\">Hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.3922%; text-align: left;\">Hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 n\u1ebfu n\u1ed9i dung b\u1eaft trend, h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 50.2123%; text-align: left;\">Cao \u2013 nh\u1edd kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng remarketing v\u00e0 t\u00edch h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-COj2dXAWVoAUoZxr9XdlKXaDgGf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>K\u1ebft lu\u1eadn:<\/strong> S\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0o &#8220;hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i&#8221; cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ecdi doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u2014 TikTok Ads hay Facebook Ads hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung b\u1ea1n tri\u1ec3n khai. Tuy nhi\u00ean, Lemon c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 g\u1ee3i \u00fd l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R0AOdOSOToPPQyxIoyLlsKMlgZf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ecdn TikTok Ads n\u1ebfu:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KSEqdStWDooUa5xHNCblG9k2gSd\">\u00a0\u00a0&#8211; B\u1ea1n nh\u1eafm \u0111\u1ebfn Gen Z ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u1ebb<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gnf5dWa76oMLUjxan6ql8PpzgUg\">\u00a0\u00a0&#8211; C\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, video b\u1eaft m\u1eaft<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SE4SdKE9uocWkqxnMWwle5aNgjf\">\u00a0\u00a0&#8211; Ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch v\u1eeba ph\u1ea3i, mu\u1ed1n t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9 lan truy\u1ec1n nhanh<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qx51dVVgxoTvHux2VkAl3dFrgfe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ecdn Facebook Ads n\u1ebfu:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IVLWdOxWFoFXxUxdIeMlm5NWgQc\">\u00a0\u00a0&#8211; B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i s\u00e2u, remarketing, ho\u1eb7c ch\u1ea1y nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTp1dMA0YoL1UQx9i0Yl7bOWgFn\">\u00a0\u00a0&#8211; \u0110\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111a d\u1ea1ng t\u1eeb tr\u1ebb \u0111\u1ebfn trung ni\u00ean<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwlXdn6UlormA5xNKLjlIQLJgWb\">\u00a0\u00a0&#8211; B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 website, fanpage m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n khai th\u00e1c s\u00e2u t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JXfbdeuVBoUXs7xXWq0lG8DZgPg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FO2YdSpxoo7RObx5ynWlt67bgud\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5fd748ec-009c-4a02-8cbf-1689039c